# Pricing reference (project-local)

Copy to `.codex/brand/pricing.md` and adjust. `hourly_rate` in `brand.profile.json`
overrides these lines when set.

hourly_rate: 195
currency: BRL
locale: pt-BR

## Client-facing rate

Use the unified engineering rate in proposals and SOWs. Profile-level repasse
tables belong in this file or in a separate `pricing-profiles.md` — never in
global Flow scripts.

## Formulas

```
PRECO = horas_totais × hourly_rate
```

Document discounts, sponsorships, and payment milestones in the proposal itself.
